


translate simplified_chinese a05_ang_09_94075671:



    voice "SYO_0099"
    sachiko "「唔……」"


translate simplified_chinese a05_ang_09_985db5c6:



    voice "FUM_0482"
    fumi "「……知道这是什么的羽毛吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a05_ang_09_49b84b25:



    voice "SYO_0100"
    sachiko "「不知道。诶嘿」"


translate simplified_chinese a05_ang_09_2647d346:


    "祥子像是为了让我看清楚，拿着那根羽毛转来转去。"


translate simplified_chinese a05_ang_09_4475ce7e:


    "那根羽毛真的是我掉下来的吗？"


translate simplified_chinese a05_ang_09_c7e3dd5c:


    "如果是照片就算了，根本无法想象会留下这么明显的痕迹。"


translate simplified_chinese a05_ang_09_8bd01df8:



    voice "SYO_0104"
    sachiko "「既然没有人能进入这个房间，也就是说，犯人（天使）就在你们之中！嗙！」"


translate simplified_chinese a05_ang_09_a4bf96e6:


    "惊。"


translate simplified_chinese a05_ang_09_8fbe07c8:



    voice "HIN_0657"
    hina "「才不搞呢！赶紧回去！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a05_ang_09_67682fbe:


    "祥子被赶出了房间，我也跟着她来到了走廊。"


translate simplified_chinese a05_ang_09_0fd4d656:


    "…………"


translate simplified_chinese a05_ang_09_cb4ec7e4:



    voice "SYO_0207"
    sachiko "「锵♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a05_ang_09_94004a03:


    "啊。"


translate simplified_chinese a05_ang_09_e8fb6d9c:



    voice "SYO_0208"
    sachiko "「被我调包了」"


translate simplified_chinese a05_ang_09_0ea4fc40:


    "来到房间外面的走廊后，祥子从口袋里掏出一根羽毛。"


translate simplified_chinese a05_ang_09_e50d7467:



    voice "SYO_0209"
    sachiko "「现在她们拿着的是鹅毛。从阳菜亲的羽绒服里借了一根出来」"


translate simplified_chinese a05_ang_09_5c0b3f35:



    voice "2SA_0027"
    sachiko "「竟然掉下羽毛了，这是不是已经有点向人类这一侧靠拢了呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a05_ang_09_b8e3f6a8:



    voice "SYO_0210"
    sachiko "「综上所述，今后要多加注意啦……不过你也没办法看到的吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a05_ang_09_cf2f97eb:


    "祥子如此说道并转动着手上的羽毛。"


translate simplified_chinese a05_ang_09_fb19515f:



    voice "SYO_0211"
    sachiko "「能看见这根羽毛的只有她们」"


translate simplified_chinese a05_ang_09_be622746:


    "你也能看见吧。"


translate simplified_chinese a05_ang_09_d9077a61:



    voice "SYO_0212"
    sachiko "「那些孩子们可是特别的存在噢」"


translate simplified_chinese a05_ang_09_2bb3413a:


    "特别？"


translate simplified_chinese a05_ang_09_e947fdf8:



    voice "SYO_0213"
    sachiko "「因为她们连我的事情都还记得啊——」"
